Important Fix

Currently we send a Google token directly as a JWT.

Production flow should be:

Google Token
       |
       ↓
Backend verifies
       |
       ↓
Backend creates JWT
       |
       ↓
Extension stores JWT
       |
       ↓
Future API calls use JWT

For MVP testing this works, but before publishing we should change it.

